message: If you use zelph in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "zelph: a semantic network system and reasoning engine"
abstract: >-
  A semantic network and reasoning engine in which the rules reside within the
  graph: contradiction detection over Wikidata, mathematics derived from axioms,
  and a reconstructible proof for every answer.
type: software
authors:
